{
  "about": [
    "Observation evidence flattened into the existing evidence shape (D8): no new keys, rank always null.",
    "Structured data stays in the judgment row, found by source_ref obs:<set_id>:<row_id>. Premise 1: an unobserved value is the",
    "empty string with the kind's unobserved phrase in note, never 0 or \"0\". obs_trends grades by value: rising and emerging are",
    "confirmed or first, cooling and the empty value are the empty grade. obs_gsc's grade is the row's admission and its label",
    "names the row's state (a formal label, or present); descriptive hits go in note. Links ride on the obs_trends entry of that",
    "geo, or on the obs_gsc entry when there is no Trends row (site_only), never on obs_discovery, as one note segment",
    "联动：<LINK_LABEL_TEXT[code]>（<code>；可行动|不可行动：<reasons in order>；判定于 T）; label_not_actionable is listed exactly",
    "when the code is global_parallel or different_markets, and those two are never 可行动."
  ],
